1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,630
Move just one eye.

2
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:02,775
Only your left.

3
00:00:02,775 --> 00:00:03,670
Go!

4
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,690
Can't?

5
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:05,447
Your eyes are

6
00:00:05,447 --> 00:00:07,100
on ONE leash.

7
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:08,030
Look left.

8
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:08,880
Look right.

9
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,998
One tug...

10
00:00:09,998 --> 00:00:11,233
BOTH go.

11
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,740
Now close one eye.

12
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,200
Fingertip on the lid.

13
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,290
Look around.

14
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:16,031
Feel that?

15
00:00:16,031 --> 00:00:17,260
Still walking...

16
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,500
blindfolded.

17
00:00:18,542 --> 00:00:19,790
A chameleon gets

18
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:21,140
TWO leashes.

19
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,340
One eye forward...

20
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,333
one eye back.

21
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:26,039
Until it spots a fly.

22
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:28,233
Now try the RIGHT one.

